{"server":"tw","storyId":"act9d0_level_act9d0_06_beg","groupId":"act9d0","stageId":"act9d0_08","title":"離散","storyCode":"DM-8","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act9d0/level_act9d0_06_beg.txt","sourceHash":"169dd698fe3ec1bf18221b9b6c029001a3ebda31f3ac0598b0cc2a28d3e13104","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"愛國者曾向W詢問卡茲戴爾的過往，而眼下，赫德雷也不得不為了蒙蔽敵手而前往維多利亞。孑然一身的W將要決定自己的命運。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"數月前，與整合運動接洽後\n10:14  P.M.    天氣/晴\n烏薩斯，無名城郊荒漠"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_a"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"......你和整合運動的領袖們都見過了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"感覺如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"你問我，還是問她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"問我的話，我只能說不出所料。差不多就該是這些傢伙，來做這些事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"很奇特。有被刻意引導而推上那個位置而變得殘暴的小孩，也有堅韌到超乎想像的戰士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"有很了不起的傢伙，但也有很無趣的反派。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"總的來說呢，打了那麼多年仗，我們見得也不少了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，有個人倒是讓我很在意......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊，你說那個啊。一直和另一個小兔子待在一邊的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"他們的隊伍給人的感覺和其他感染者完全不同。這種薩卡茲戰士才算得上是戰爭的符號。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"但也很少能見到那樣的薩卡茲啊，而且他自稱烏薩斯人，也早就和卡茲戴爾斷了聯繫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"真可憐啊，他本可以不用活得這麼疲憊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"也許我們都該見見他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"他給人留下的感覺，超過了“戰士”這個範疇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"你啊，不是總喜歡想很多嗎？比起乾想，不如去找他那種人聊聊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"我們也許都能從他身上學到不少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"你們說的是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"打擾，我想，單獨見見你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......真是說來就來，這麼巧的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"您是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我，是誰，暫且，不重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，我並非，以領袖的名義，來見你們，請放心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是想，來聽一聽......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"同胞，和家鄉，發生的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，在卡茲戴爾，發生了，許多事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我，有所耳聞，卻不知詳情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"你只是個烏薩斯人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這兩者，並不衝突。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"血脈，從未改變。黑暗，根深蒂固。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我雖從未在意，但也都，無法動搖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼就算你知道了，又打算做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"都已經是很久以前的事情了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不會，做什麼，也不能，做什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，在很久以前，我見過，特蕾西婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"——嚯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們的反應，我明白。她也在你們這，留下了痕跡。畢竟，你們也是，薩卡茲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"泥濘的，也好，血腥的，也罷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她是英雄，至少，被如此推崇。她，偉大的戰士，也是，難得的君主。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的血肉，忠於烏薩斯，我的族群，自我流放，但我，還是薩卡茲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想知道，她的，卡茲戴爾，發生了什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是，想要知道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_a"},{"type":"narration","text":"現在，切爾諾伯格轉移途中\n5:22  A.M.    天氣/晴\n切爾諾伯格，薩卡茲傭兵駐紮區"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......你找我有事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"我們希望薩卡茲雇傭兵隊伍能給出一個解釋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"先是有你的隊伍叛逃，而前去追擊的人彙報說，你根本沒有全力以赴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"數個小時前，又有敵人潛伏進切爾諾伯格，同樣是你們的失職。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"再加上最早攻佔切爾諾伯格的時候，有人報告你放走了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，好了好了，我明白客戶的不滿了，能少說兩句嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"我們只是“合作”關係，現在我是領袖，如果我現在拍桌子翻臉，塔露拉會高興嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"還是愛國者老爺子讓你們產生了......整合運動真的精於戰爭的錯覺？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"不要搞錯到底是哪些人才能為你們帶來勝利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"想明白了就趕緊滾回去，告訴那個龍女，她該知道的事情我會去找她的，不要這麼著急。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"還有一件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"就在剛剛，城內發現了潛入的敵軍殘黨。薩卡茲雇傭兵伊內絲，與對方交火後同歸於盡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"整合運動也參與了這場阻擊戰，敵人很強，我們都遭到了損失。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"這都是你的失職所致。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......別這麼急著咄咄逼人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才，似乎東邊有些動靜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"那......屍體呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"很遺憾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"我問的是敵人的屍體，伊內絲可不會什麼誇張的殺傷性法術。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的術師也參加了戰鬥，整條街道都毀於一旦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"——你們這也太明目張膽了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道你在說什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......那在你們看來，這件事應該怎麼處理？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"......我們的主要兵力正著眼於將要在龍門發生的戰鬥，無暇顧及。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"領袖暫時不會深究你的責任。你們應該自行處理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......你的烏薩斯口音很重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"......所以呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"你們......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......該不會真覺得，隨便找個藉口就行了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"W，停下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"（把你手裡的遙控法杖放下，冷靜。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，稍微有點激動，當然你也可以先鬆口氣，慶幸自己撿回一條命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"你這是什麼意思！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......別誤會，死一個薩卡茲並不會對接下來的作戰產生什麼影響。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"死一個整合運動，也一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你不信，大可以親自試一試。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"......我會把你的態度如實轉告領袖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有下一次。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_a"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"你都聽到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"從你放過羅德島的那支隊伍開始，整合運動就從來不會讓我們單獨行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"如果他們真能把這種謹慎全部放在正面戰場，也不至於打的這麼慘吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"即使這樣你還是故意放跑了背叛的刀術師。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......我可沒有故意放走他，我只是不想讓那些蠢貨感染者殺掉我自己帶過來的薩卡茲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果是以前，你會毫不猶豫地殺了炎客，用他的性命蒙蔽整合運動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"無論你到底想要什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼？原來只有我記不住他的代號？那不是很尷尬？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"伊內絲剛才真的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"先別提她......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"她......我會讓人去確認的，確認她的......嘁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"先說正事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"......三件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"第一，伊內絲要提醒你，塔露拉的情況不對。她看到的肯定更加具體，但我不清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"她只說過，塔露拉似乎有“兩個影子”。從她的反應來看，這並不是普通法術干擾的結果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼每次都不把話說清楚，這個膽小鬼真是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"第二，老爺子動身了，奉命去取一件東西。塔露拉根本沒有打算隱瞞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"......第三，信使已經出發前往維多利亞，很快，攝政王就會知道這裡發生的一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"特雷西斯知道的東西很多很多，他身邊的怪物同樣不少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"如果讓他攪局，這就不光是整合運動和烏薩斯之間這麼簡單的問題了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"W！你在聽嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......吵死了，既然全是喜訊，就先讓我安靜一會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"從進門開始......你的手就按在刀柄上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"我們第一次見面的時候，你就是這樣，好像隨時準備拔刀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"你剛才冷靜的就像是愛國者那樣——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"其實你是怎麼想的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"這不重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"我們都一樣啊，深諳此道，陋習難改。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"伊內絲她......."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"她說的話，我姑且記一下吧，為了尊重她的犧牲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"......你們很像，做事從來不會考慮後果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"攝政王不會坐視這邊失去控制，如果不能給他合適的答案，倫蒂尼姆的傳喚會毀掉你精心準備好的一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"諷刺的是，我到現在都不知道你到底想做什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......誰知道呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"不要覺得自己真的能處理一切，W，你遲早會後悔的，像我一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"你有發問的權利，是你避開了漩渦的中央。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎？那麼現在的羅德島上具體有哪些人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......為什麼這麼問？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"我看過你和信使的聯絡，你一直在調查羅德島號的蹤跡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"這家製藥公司......本以為只是和那場戰爭稍有牽連，現在看來，根本沒那麼簡單。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"特別是，Scout和......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"......切爾諾伯格的阻擊戰我們都負責了別的戰場，按照你的規劃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯啊，你們做得很好——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"但還是有人看見他了，巴別塔的亡靈。你選擇自己去找他，然後放走了他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"放在過去，我會把這視作一次不信任的信號。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"不過看樣子，你也沒打算瞞多久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，這種事情還用瞞嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"只要正面打上兩架，那些過去在戰場上小有名氣的人，自然能認出對面是何方神聖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟那些人還實實在在地活著，這也是沒辦法的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"你打算怎麼做？和他們發生衝突本來就完全是意料之外的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"如果羅德島這家製藥公司真的還是凱爾希做主，也許會是個突破口......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"你以為我的目的是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"......我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"你們會幫我做成這件事，上次說好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"失信的雇傭兵和死掉的雇傭兵在價值上是等同的，我不介意進行一些額外處理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"伊內絲已經做不到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"而接下來......我也必須離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"這我可沒聽說過，去哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"我會和信使一起回維多利亞，三四個月的路程，我們明早日出前就要出發。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......你是急著和伊內絲殉情嗎？以你的身份，背著瀆職之罪，去倫蒂尼姆？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"你逃回卡茲戴爾的下場可能都會更好些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"你把加爾森殺了，還重組了雇傭兵，這件事必須有人彙報給攝政王。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"如果沒有人回去述職，他會把我們所有人都當做棄子，或者，把我們投入下一處戰場，他伸手可及的戰場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"到了那個時候，才是真的無處可逃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"你冒著生命風險為我打掩護？為什麼要這麼做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西婭殿下她......記得我的名字。還有我的家族。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"殿下已經不在了，不過，還是在這個糟糕的隊伍裡留下了點什麼的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"我怎麼沒有發現？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。無論有些薩卡茲的手段和性格多麼扭曲，從結果來看，都還在為那個不現實的想法而戰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......你真的知道自己在說什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"我們認識很久了，W。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"僅此而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼出於情面，我也好心提醒你一句。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"現在是你逃離卡茲戴爾最好的機會，離開這裡，繞過龍門和烏薩斯，去更遠的地方，我可以睜一隻眼閉一隻眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"但如果回去，你就會死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"呵......剛才你還說，我必須要幫你做成這件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你們幫我的方法都只是送死的話，建議你們把這條命留著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"至少該索取的時候，讓我還有債可討。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"未必是送死，根據攝政王的態度，事情會有很多種走向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"整合運動這件事被某些遠超你我想像的東西操縱了，攝政王也許會改變他的主意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"......何況現在，我已經沒有逃走的餘裕了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"離開卡茲戴爾，再離開這裡，又能怎麼樣？愛國者已經教給我夠多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼短的時間裡，你被他影響很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼短的時間裡，你也被特蕾西婭影響很多，不都一回事嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"特雷西斯高居王位，就算只能跪在黑鐵映照的地板上，我也要抵達他的王座，揣摩他的念想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"不然，我們繼續這樣魯莽行事，才叫送死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"其實你也可以選擇歸順。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"我的確這麼想過。你要知道，加爾森一直在懷疑你，他下過命令，讓我殺了你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"唔？你要是聽他的，那可能還更有意思一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思，你覺得有意思的東西，我大多都覺得沒什麼意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，決定吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......我也的確很好奇特雷西斯到底在玩什麼把戲......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"不過似乎我也沒什麼選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，就算你拒絕我的提案，我也不打算繼續讓你把控一切事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"你該不會說是為了我好吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"當然不會，哪有處處照顧他人的薩卡茲呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......你變回過去的樣子了，真無聊。我以為你會就這麼沉淪下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，你已經有計劃了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"你去問伊內絲吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"這個笑話一點都不好笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼臨行前，就再多說個笑話吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"伊內絲之前說過，你看上去變得越來越像個瘋子，手段和性格卻越來越優柔寡斷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"——我？你自己信嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"是不是最近炸彈用少了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"也許吧。你藏的再好，我們也共事太多年了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"說不定，其實我們一直都很信任你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......到底哪句算是笑話？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"......是你？薩卡茲雇傭兵，赫德雷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"聽說你要離開這裡，那找我們還有什麼事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"在出發之前，我有一些事情想要確認一下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"你們有誰親眼看見伊內絲戰死了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"——沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"我們接到請求支援的訊號時，戰鬥就已經結束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"街道被大面積損毀，天災留下的源石結晶裸露地表，產生了劇烈的連鎖反應。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"只付出了幾人的代價就解決了——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"......你幹了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"烏薩斯人，看到同伴在面前倒下，你的反應很冷靜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"你身上有熟悉的味道，陰謀的味道，戰火的味道——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"如果伊內絲還能站在這裡，她一定會這麼說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"原來如此，因為失去戰友而遷怒於感染者，這種事情並不少見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才的事，讓我以為你會比W聰明一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，現在回想起來，有點太照顧她了，一直都是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"不過也不光是為了怕她惹上麻煩，更多的，還是為了親自動手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟我也是個薩卡茲......而且貨真價實。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"你——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合運動士兵"]}]}
